  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are two common tangents of circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
